<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-BETIS BOOK SPANISH CUP FINAL PLACE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BETIS BOOK SPANISH CUP FINAL PLACE.</headline>
<dateline>VIGO, Spain 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Real Betis reached their first Spanish Cup final in 20 years on Wednesday thanks to a late goal by captain Alexis Trujillo in the 1-1 semifinal second leg draw against Celta Vigo.</p>
<p>Betis won 2-1 on aggregate to qualify for the final.</p>
